  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-14T00:56:57-04:00\" title=\"Friday, July 14, 2017, 12:56 am\">July 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<figure id=\"attachment_3162\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3162\" src=\"/media/archive/e8cbe248b3970492aaaf5207d2c3e8788cec16c1d3872b2e0a99f1402d18029e.jpg\" alt=\"Larry Folding at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1024\" height=\"756\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3162\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Larry Folding at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Sponsored by the Cape Cod Chamber of Commerce, The Cape Cod Hydrangea Festival is an annual celebration of the region’s blue, pink, and white signature flowers! All garden tour proceeds benefit local nonprofits. Members of The Guild of Harwich Artists along with <a href=\"http://www.gardenclubofharwich.org/\">The Garden Club of Harwich</a> participated in the festival on Thursday, July 13, “Gardens By The Sea”.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3169\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-3169 size-full\" src=\"/media/archive/f832f3144cccc0dd4ca176a16a2864681bd89a5f0afbab603fab8027cb6dc2fd.jpg\" alt=\"Barbara Quinn Grasso at Backyard Retreat, Urban Design, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"926\" height=\"675\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3169\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Barbara Quinn Grasso at Backyard Retreat, Urban Design, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3165\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3165\" src=\"/media/archive/75a3cf8c24ad26d4c1a7a6562543ed471492f5f205b3f2383dcb4a20e9dab7cc.jpg\" alt=\"Carroll Sivco at Backyard Retreat, Urban Design, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"905\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3165\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Carroll Sivco at Backyard Retreat, Urban Design, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3159\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3159\" src=\"/media/archive/7b4b26e5214982981ae19b0086313c7cd9ef8270b55cdef2d013ac280ce81917.jpg\" alt=\"Chris Banks at Kiyushu and Limelights and Quickfires, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3159\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Chris Banks at Kiyushu and Limelights and Quickfires, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3154\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3154\" src=\"/media/archive/1241d7e89737d8c08e1399bd1ac7c73d1e977f7126fd59cf2a2005b6e8feb965.jpg\" alt=\"Martha Little Fuentes at Tuscan Village, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1024\" height=\"696\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3154\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Martha Little Fuentes at Tuscan Village, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3153\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3153\" src=\"/media/archive/b51430f1e69a1759239e66080115cf036ab7e0d7ae068fa8209939f5eaa97d4f.jpg\" alt=\"Maryrose Reynolds at Tuscan Village, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1002\" height=\"768\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3153\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Maryrose Reynolds at Tuscan Village, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3150\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3150\" src=\"/media/archive/dd3cc1b48be13481b053191535f63656ad12327972b4c9f945fbe2905671783a.jpg\" alt=\"Kathy ElKamouny and Weedie Tyldesley at Tranquility Garden, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3150\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kathy ElKamouny and Weedie Tyldesley at Tranquility Garden, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3157\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3157\" src=\"/media/archive/a38c715cc3a5633c7cb5a04bef6c106601948f6c271ebcf55f0b0ff46895fb21.jpg\" alt=\"Jeanne Tassinari at Kiyushu and Limelights and Quickfires, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1024\" height=\"744\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3157\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Jeanne Tassinari at Kiyushu and Limelights and Quickfires, Harwich Port. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3146\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3146\" src=\"/media/archive/66ad518952281ae84f99eca7d6aed79184030eae6cea3f4ff0a264b2a3baaf05.jpg\" alt=\"Doris Mee at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1009\" height=\"768\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3146\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Doris Mee at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-32cd4b4ee490840b3094/\" rel=\"tag\">EN PLEIN AIR</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-68e0b126d5e9c961b851/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod Hydrangea Festival</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-c5a0664c0f5b2d29d271/\" rel=\"tag\">Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-1703c3c657d21bda0b89/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich Garden Club</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a78c41d2215f142284bf/\" rel=\"tag\">The Warm Side of the Cape</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
